Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is now over, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yook!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, hatred never triumphs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I had the perfect strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark paladin would disagree, Kaiba,\Nbut thanks to his attack, you've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there must be some mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba was fighting for\Nall the wrong reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the end, it was his own\Nanger and jealousy that did him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City is my tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire event was designed so\Nthat I would be the ultimate victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to put the memory\Nof my stepfather behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and be crowned the world's best\Nduelist atop my duel tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead, it's Yugi\Nwho now stands victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:01:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory was in my grasp,\Nbut it somehow slipped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's over. I'm nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner is Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,who now advances to the final round and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.69,0:02:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,faces Marek Ishtar for\Nthe Battle City Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the man, Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.29,0:02:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.33,0:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never let a freak show\Nlike Maric get the best of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I gave you my word\Nthat I'd help you beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So here I am. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The gang's together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some ending, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the way my red-eyes black dragon\Ncame through and helped Yugi to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you were snoozing,\Nbut your card wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I was there for my pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for him, I would\Nnever have crushed Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-eyes ultimate dragon, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, the one and only, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to lose this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you always tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely and consider\Nall your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my options? Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find a\Ncard that can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Joey's red eyes, I\Ngot the power boost I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We won this duel together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's out of the\Ntournament now. He's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But he came so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck was unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I executed my strategy perfectly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,carefully playing each\Ncard exactly as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the most challenging\Nduel I've ever fought, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just save it. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny may have chosen me to be the\Nvictor, Kaiba, but you fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need the pep talk, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite obvious to me that you haven't\Nlearned anything from our duel today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd say that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never truly be\Na success until you're
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,able to conquer the\Nmonsters within your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.03,0:04:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Deny the truth, and it will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You were doomed from the start,\Nfueled by your anger, your hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,your jealousy, your rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And lastly, the denial of your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, was fueled by faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Faith in destiny and faith in my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Joey was\Nunconscious for most of my duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it was like he was right here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I could\Nhave beaten Kaiba without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it was Joey's Red-Eyes Black\NDragon that made my victory possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I didn't crush you on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and I did it together\Nusing the card he gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Red eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you used your flute of summoning dragon\Nto summon your blue eyes to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But you may not have realized that\Nyour flute works on my hand as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So I owe you a thank you\Nfor bringing out this card,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,which is a gift from a very\Nclose friend of mine, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Eyes is no ordinary card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Its strength comes from the\Nbond of my friendship with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I never duel alone, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You never duel alone? Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that every single\None of us is alone in this world, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had to ask for anyone's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've helped Kaiba plenty of times\Nbefore, and he's helped me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I wouldn't be the duelist I am\Ntoday if he hadn't pushed me to be my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be one of my toughest rivals,\Nbut I also consider him a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, I bet Kaiba\Nfeels the same way about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just too caught up in his\Nneed for power to realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't consider anyone\Nyour friend, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship is for fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you I duel alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,depending on others is for the weak yugi\Nmy future is in my own two hands so keep
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,your friendships to\Nyourself i'm not interested
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,in having any pals to slow me down how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,sad the time has come to accept my defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,like a man yugi since there's no one else
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that i rely on there's no one else that i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,can blame as per the\Nrules take my rarest card
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have two Egyptian God cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you duel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who gets the third place crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you're\Nscared of losing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're too good for\Nthe rest of us, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I used to be a stubborn\Njerk just like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked on everyone else\Nand inside I felt alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I was in a tough situation\Nand Yugi stuck out his neck for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed me what friendship is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I realize that looking out for\Nother people actually makes us stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi changed my life that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've seen Yugi stick his neck out\Nfor you a whole bunch of times, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And did you ever once say thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you need friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take away all your Kaiba Corp\Nflunkies and who's left on your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All this nonsense about friendship\Nis starting to bore me, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing my brother\Nneeds is a lecture from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so why don't you just lay off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you defend this guy\Nafter what he said about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was happy being all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess what that means is\Nhe doesn't need you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Some big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing\Nbut bust my chops about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,my duel monster skills\Never since I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:09:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it seems like you're afraid of losing\Nto me and looking like a fool, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Push me too far and\Nyou'll regret it, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you gonna duel me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't see what the\Npoint is other than to waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'd crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then prove it to me, rich boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I've had\Nenough of your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept this ridiculous\Nchallenge of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, we agree on something.\NBut, Seto... Relax, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll silence this\Namateur once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, as soon as you and I begin\Nthis duel of ours, Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,all the friends on Earth won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate battle is fast approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the pharaoh will face my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and the future of mankind\Nwill depend on the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you even without\Nmy Egyptian god card, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your best shot, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, it won't take my best\Nto defeat an amateur like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take your worst shot\Nfor all I can, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a duel to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen Joey\Nlook this confident before, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey has certainly come an extremely\Nlong way to get where he is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows he can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, alligator sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach this fraud a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Battle Warrior and Swordsman\Nof Lamstar attack his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Maric quivered in fear when\Nfaced with Joey's skills. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,now I can sacrifice all\Nthree of my monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring out my ultimate fighting machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Gilbert the Lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, show him what your special ability\Nis all about and wipe out his eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,With everything Joey's learned\Nfrom this Battle City Tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say he has a good chance at\Nfinally defeating Kaiba Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and earning the respect he\Ndeserves from that stuck-up punk
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, please, take me to my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even let you go first, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.05,0:11:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to show this third-rate\Nwannabe what real dueling is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play Ryukushin Powered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place two cards\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never survive my shrink\Nand crush card combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than\Nthat to beat me, rich boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Gierfried, the Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all about you and\Nyour face-down strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You were probably all jazzed up\Nabout your two face-down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, tough noogies, magic cards\Ndon't work on Gear Freed. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This may sound crazy, but I think\NJoey's using his head out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He better not think too hard\Nor he might hurt himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd Taya go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably just went to\Nthe bathroom or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, you own\Nthis guy! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Gear Freed, attack\Nhis Ryukushin right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't be so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal my magic card! Shrink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.11,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch closely because my magic\Ncard has the power to weaken any
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,monster on the field by cutting\Nits attack points right in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, it's not your Iron Knight\NI plan to use this card on. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using it to shrink my own monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, he's done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Wheeler, you're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now that my monster has\Nless than 1,000 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can activate this card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.97,0:13:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,my Crush Card Trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This infects my own monster\Nwith a devastating virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that your gear freed\Nattacked it, that virus will spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First it destroys your\Nmonster on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,then the virus spreads to\Nyour hand, then your deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,crushing every strong beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, yes. Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster with 1,500\Nattack points or more in Joey's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,hand and deck will be destroyed\Nby Kaiba's crush card trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo, Guildford, every one of\Nmy powerful monsters is toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A weak duelist should\Nhave weak monsters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you you couldn't handle\Nan opponent like me. Zip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just admit\Nyou're in over your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.89,0:14:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, and leave now\Nbefore you hurt yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel just started, and I got\Nstrategies you never dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know when it's time to quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have no monsters to\Nprotect you, well, you figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon La Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the mystical genie of the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, Joey's life points\Nare wide open to an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This could get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's time to say goodbye\Nto 1,800 of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now La Jin, attack him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is near, Shizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.21,0:15:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem a bit lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, it's me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, your good side is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Had enough yet, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Kaiba's trap card,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,all I've got to work with are\Nthese minor league monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to beat you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This could definitely help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll summon Swordsman of Landstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thinking, Joey. Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,that magic card is an\Nexcellent way to increase
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the attacking power of your weak monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can turn this tool around, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Joey's Swordsman of Landstar can gain
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,enough strength to take\Ndown Kaiba's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He just has to roll a high enough\Nnumber using his graceful dice card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Kaiba's genie\Nhas 1,800 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means Joey's got to roll at\Nleast a four if he wants to beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs a new pair of shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Chewie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, four or higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.31,0:17:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's four!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In your face, Kyber!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My swordsman's attack points quadrupled,\Nmaking it stronger than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Great dueling!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call a close one,\Nbut I can't let Kaiba see me sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win a duel with luck, chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but it certainly gave my swordsman\Nenough power to cut your genie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad, now you're another 200 life\Npoints closer to losing this duel, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So you won that battle,\Nbut you won't win the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, it's been so long\Nsince you last appeared to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.97,0:18:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You must save Odeon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that your good half took\Nshelter within Taya's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also knew you were weak,\Nand couldn't hold on for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As my dark side grows strong, I grow weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been in Taya's mind long enough\Nto have learned the truth about our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Through her ears, I listen to\Nyou tell the story of our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and the emergence of the evil within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I don't, Merrick, drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew that I was the one who\Nsent Father to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.79,0:18:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but... I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the evil force within\Nme that committed the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So you came here to save me from myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite everything I've done in my\Nquest for power, you've had faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew there was still good within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that good is almost\Ncompletely extinguished now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If the evil force defeats the\Npharaoh in the final battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be gone forever, and the\Nentire planet will suffer greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't allow one duel to\Ndecide the fate of the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come for me to step\Nin and reclaim my body, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.85,0:19:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I must banish\Nthat evil before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just too much at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's far too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, take care of Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, don't go, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, come back.
